条件、监查报告模板及盲态维护核查程序，以项目监查计划为准。","rationale":"多中心双盲设计事实来自当前项目研究定义；源文件保存与监查访问权限的表述参照公司语料中CMD-D001-AD方案第10.3节，属于监管共性结构条款。本项目的监查频率、远程监查适用条件、盲态核查程序及监查报告模板缺少项目级监查计划，已列入gap_items。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_60aa08d5ccf9_abfc5d3584b9ee33","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:635bb2193d62e1bd8b09fb65","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8f0bceaab777ef645d88:r4:cbb1bfff5749c317","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f124dc45ec3cd8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bc1113fc7a275b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010000058_a25303ba","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:10.3 源数据/源文件|block:914|chunk:1","quote":"用于验证eCRFs输入数据正确性和完整性的源文件不得被清除或销毁，且必须按照第10.4节中描述的记录保存要求保存。为方便于源数据验证，研究者和机构必须允许申办者因为研究相关的监查、申办者稽查和IRB/EC审查而直接访问源文件和报告（如得到法律允许，也可以复制）。研究中心还必须允许监管当局对源数据/源文件进行检查。","quote_sha256":"4ee376e682efffc8b2574ea340689c38a62f55144912d733d54df104f527ce93","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bc1113fc7a275b","span_id":"es_03"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_03"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"需项目稽查计划明确稽查覆盖的研究阶段、频率及触发稽查的条件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_3_01","missing_source_classes":["项目级稽查计划"],"target":"稽查范围、频率与触发条件"},{"action":"需项目核查应对预案明确核查接待职责、文件准备清单及整改跟踪机制","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_3_02","missing_source_classes":["核查应对预案"],"target":"监管核查应对流程"}],"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":["项目级稽查计划","核查应对预案"],"proposal_text":"申办者有权对本研究进行独立于研究团队的稽查，以评估研究执行是否符合研究方案、药物临床试验质量管理规范及适用法规要求。研究者和研究中心必须允许申办者稽查人员因研究相关的稽查而直接访问源文件和报告，如得到法律允许，也可以复制。研究中心还必须允许监管当局对源数据与源文件进行检查。稽查范围、频率、触发条件及稽查报告的流转与整改跟踪机制，以项目稽查计划为准。监管核查的应对流程、接待职责及文件准备要求，以项目核查应对预案为准。","rationale":"稽查与核查中源文件访问权限的表述参照公司语料中CMD-D001-AD方案第10.3节，属于监管共性结构条款，未继承竞品项目事实。本项目的稽查范围、频率、触发条件及核查应对流程缺少项目级稽查计划和核查应对预案，已列入gap_items。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_60aa08d5ccf9_3c778c9476584f91","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:635bb2193d62e1bd8b09fb65","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8f0bceaab777ef645d88:r4:cbb1bfff5749c317","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f124dc45ec3cd8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bc1113fc7a275b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"3d0922674e1cd1e786bba89579d4da04107adaf7561e8a3b1f7edc682d1514c1","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_60aa08d5ccf9_9eaec061c1b07dd7:full-draft:635bb2193d62e1bd8b09fb65","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:635bb2193d62e1bd8b09fb65","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:861172e6b952fc5c2a078ace1a9f91473d8b46589dafe35c80c75521bdc04d58:635bb2193d62e1bd8b09fb65","text_sha256":"3d0922674e1cd1e786bba89579d4da04107adaf7561e8a3b1f7edc682d1514c1"},{"content_sha256":"aac7656795aa239d613ae05aa9d631e7ef9d76a69f15468f6ed0b7692b2c4392","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8f0bceaab777ef645d88:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8f0bceaab777ef645d88:r4:cbb1bfff5749c317","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_8f0bceaab777ef645d88:r4:cbb1bfff5749c317","text_sha256":"aac7656795aa239d613ae05aa9d631e7ef9d76a69f15468f6ed0b7692b2c4392"},{"content_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483ada